# Google OAuth client id for real sign-in.
#
#   1. console.cloud.google.com  ->  APIs & Services  ->  Credentials
#   2. Create credentials  ->  OAuth client ID  ->  Web application
#   3. Authorised JavaScript origins:  http://localhost:5173
#   4. Authorised redirect URIs:       http://localhost:5173/
#   5. Copy the client id below into a file named  .env
#
# Without this the app signs in with a demo identity instead.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
